# "in your graveyard" (CR 608.2c): Bot2's Shatter puts Bot2's own Mox Ruby - an artifact card - in Bot2's graveyard on turn
# 2, and Bot1's Ceti Eel on turn 3 mills two lands (a Forest and an Island), so the count of artifact and creature cards in
# Bot1's graveyard is none: no counter, still a 2/2, and Bot2's artifact card stays where it is.

